{"id": 970, "content": "<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#3D2E0A;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:56px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:48px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F7F3EC;font-size:clamp(22.041px, 1.378rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.369), 36px);line-height:1.25\">The shop</h1>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#B7C0C2;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.196), 16px);\">Solar kits, batteries and portable power stations, by level of self-sufficiency. Delivery to France and Spain.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:48px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:48px;padding-left:24px\">\n<div class=\"solandvolt-grid\">\n  <div class=\"solandvolt-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-badge\">Level 01</div>\n    <h3>The Night Light</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-subtitle\">A lamp, a charger, a small battery. Everything you need to get through an evening without power.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-duration\">12 products</div>\n    <a href=\"/en/shop/night-light/\" class=\"card-btn wp-element-button\">Browse →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"solandvolt-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-badge\">Level 02</div>\n    <h3>The Module</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-subtitle\">Portable power stations and solar panels. Router, lights and phones — from an evening to a full day.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-duration\">12 products</div>\n    <a href=\"/en/shop/the-module/\" class=\"card-btn wp-element-button\">Browse →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"solandvolt-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-badge\">Level 03</div>\n    <h3>The Base</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-subtitle\">High-capacity stations and solar panels. The fridge keeps running — a full day and beyond with the sun.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-duration\">15 products</div>\n    <a href=\"/en/shop/the-base/\" class=\"card-btn wp-element-button\">Browse →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"solandvolt-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-badge\">Level 04</div>\n    <h3>Self-Sufficiency</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-subtitle\">Your home generates and stores part of its own energy, every day. Less dependence on the grid.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-duration\">8 products</div>\n    <a href=\"/en/shop/self-sufficiency/\" class=\"card-btn wp-element-button\">Browse →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"solandvolt-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-badge\">Storage</div>\n    <h3>Batteries</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-subtitle\">LiFePO4 batteries for storage and off-grid setups.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-duration\">2 products</div>\n    <a href=\"/en/shop/batteries/\" class=\"card-btn wp-element-button\">Browse →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"solandvolt-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-badge\">Comfort</div>\n    <h3>Portable Cooling</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-subtitle\">Evaporative coolers and air conditioners with low power draw — compatible with our power stations.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-duration\">4 products</div>\n    <a href=\"/en/shop/cooling/\" class=\"card-btn wp-element-button\">Browse →</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-top-color:#E6DFCF;border-top-width:1px;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:48px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:56px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1F2A2E;font-size:clamp(15.747px, 0.984rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.809), 24px);\">Our most popular power stations</h2>\n<div class=\"woocommerce columns-3 \"><ul class=\"products columns-3\">\n<li class=\"product type-product status-publish instock has-post-thumbnail taxable shipping-taxable purchasable product-type-simple\">\n\t<a href=\"/en/shop/ecoflow-river-3-plus/\" class=\"woocommerce-LoopProduct-link woocommerce-loop-product__link\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.solandvolt.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/ECF0043_56891-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-woocommerce_thumbnail size-woocommerce_thumbnail\" alt=\"EcoFlow River 3 Plus – 600 W Portable Power Station\" /><h2 class=\"woocommerce-loop-product__title\">EcoFlow River 3 Plus – 600 W Portable Power Station</h2>\n\t<span class=\"price\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi>€299.00</bdi></span></span>\n</a><a href=\"?add-to-cart=623\" data-quantity=\"1\" class=\"button wp-element-button product_type_simple add_to_cart_button ajax_add_to_cart\" data-product_id=\"623\" data-product_sku=\"SV-ECF0043\" rel=\"nofollow\" role=\"button\">Add to cart</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"product type-product status-publish instock has-post-thumbnail taxable shipping-taxable purchasable product-type-simple\">\n\t<a href=\"/en/shop/ac70p-portable-power-station/\" class=\"woocommerce-LoopProduct-link woocommerce-loop-product__link\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.solandvolt.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1059175180-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-woocommerce_thumbnail size-woocommerce_thumbnail\" alt=\"AC70P Portable Power Station\" /><h2 class=\"woocommerce-loop-product__title\">AC70P Portable Power Station</h2>\n\t<span class=\"price\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi>€539.90</bdi></span></span>\n</a><a href=\"?add-to-cart=346\" data-quantity=\"1\" class=\"button wp-element-button product_type_simple add_to_cart_button ajax_add_to_cart\" data-product_id=\"346\" data-product_sku=\"SV-STAT-BL70\" rel=\"nofollow\" role=\"button\">Add to cart</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"product type-product status-publish instock has-post-thumbnail taxable shipping-taxable purchasable product-type-simple\">\n\t<a href=\"/en/shop/ecoflow-delta-3/\" class=\"woocommerce-LoopProduct-link woocommerce-loop-product__link\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.solandvolt.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/ECF0040_55689-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-woocommerce_thumbnail size-woocommerce_thumbnail\" alt=\"EcoFlow DELTA 3 Portable Power Station – 1,024 Wh, 1,800 W\" /><h2 class=\"woocommerce-loop-product__title\">EcoFlow DELTA 3 Portable Power Station – 1,024 Wh, 1,800 W</h2>\n\t<span class=\"price\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi>€799.00</bdi></span></span>\n</a><a href=\"?add-to-cart=344\" data-quantity=\"1\" class=\"button wp-element-button product_type_simple add_to_cart_button ajax_add_to_cart\" data-product_id=\"344\" data-product_sku=\"SV-ECF0040\" rel=\"nofollow\" role=\"button\">Add to cart</a>\n</li>\n</ul></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#5F6A6C;font-size:13px;margin-top:24px\">Product detail pages are in French for now — questions in English? Write to us: <a href=\"mailto:contact@solandvolt.com\">contact@solandvolt.com</a>. Checkout and customer account are in French; we reply in English.</p>\n</div>"}